[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584375\">1092B50</a></p><p>1. Completely undo the bolts (1a) and remove the components drive\nbelt moving tensioner (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021267.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the components drive belt moving\ntensioner back in its housing and secure it with the locking bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584375\">1092B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584376\">1092B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]